  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT Control 16 combines polyester and nylon microfibers inside a polyurethane matrix to create a premium hybrid multifilament string. Polyester improves feel and directional control, while nylon enhances comfort and forgiveness. Designed for players who want the control of polyester with the comfort of Wilson NXT, it also delivers excellent shock absorption and clean response on off-center shots.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT Control 16 是一款采用聚酯微纤维、尼龙微纤维以及聚氨酯复合结构的高端多芯混合球线。聚酯提供更好的击球反馈与控制，尼龙则带来更高的舒适性和容错率，整体兼具聚酯的精准与 NXT 系列的柔和手感。它特别适合力量型球员，希望拥有聚酯控制力，同时降低对手臂负担。"
  },

